{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000025502","bookName":"La pequeña que salvó a toda la familia","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000025502/42000025502.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":383869,"followCount":8438,"introduction":"La pequeñita que llevaba años desaparecida, al ser encontrada, despertó inesperadamente la habilidad de prever el futuro. Aunque era una niña, podía anticipar las crisis y desgracias de la familia, y advertir a los mayores para evitarlas. La familia, que antes estaba en declive, gracias a las advertencias de la pequeñita, logró salir de la crisis y prosperar paso a paso. Desde que ella regresó a casa, todos en la familia fueron salvados, uno a uno.","chapterCount":69,"labels":["Family Bonds","Lost Child"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Lost Child"],"typeTwoIds":[294,703],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica","Familia"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"},{"id":703,"name":"Familia","replaceName":"familia"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-pequeña-que-salvó-a-toda-la-familia","bookNameLower":"la-pequeña-que-salvó-a-toda-la-familia","shelfTime":"2026-08-24 16:56:31","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-24 16:56:31","performerList":[{"performerId":"19589","performerName":"Yilun Zhang","performerFormatName":"Yilun-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x8/19589/19589.jpg?time=1787558645957","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"21375","performerName":"Yuhe Zhang","performerFormatName":"Yuhe-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x7/21375/21375.jpg?time=1787558647940","videoCount":1}],"performerIdList":[19589,21375]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701517767","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/76/2x0/20x5/205x5/20552000024/701517767_1/701517767.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=RKKotS56-U1EwX3KJ4ujZJxsnvJdt~uufqenUzNrfpsHOL~i77HMV26pLAfX3dDkyErin7Muls2